linear/14038125/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "2\\pi "] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038125/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef464e5935c71b68ecd8c1ec4b87eff350c2a75b2837f3166d9e1c17350e6d62" "basis" 1295 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038125/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{\\pi }{2}"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038125/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef464e5935c71b68ecd8c1ec4b87eff350c2a75b2837f3166d9e1c17350e6d62" "basis" 1295 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038125/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-4\\pi "] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038125/state.json" "file_sha256" "ef464e5935c71b68ecd8c1ec4b87eff350c2a75b2837f3166d9e1c17350e6d62" "basis" 1295 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14038125/edb-import/verification.json"}] "sources" [{"question" "q-49682" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=2x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=2 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x) & ⇒ & v=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 2x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =2x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}2x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x){|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}-{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x){|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2}+2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x){|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /2} \\\\  & =2[\\frac{3\\pi }{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2})-\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})] \\\\  & +2[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})] \\\\  & =2[-\\frac{3\\pi }{2}-\\frac{\\pi }{2}]+2[0-0] \\\\  & =2(-2\\pi )+0 \\\\  & =-4\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a3d00a01382246c96182b28c0570276bcacf1df888d27a5c8b5dc9411c899e97"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-4\\pi "] ["math" "-\\frac{\\pi }{4}"] ["math" "-\\pi "] ["math" "2\\pi "] ["math" "\\frac{\\pi }{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-49682" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-4\\pi "] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114297" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int 3x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114297" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 3x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=3x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=3 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 3x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x & =3x\\cdot (\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3})-\\int (\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3})\\cdot 3\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 3x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)-\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)}{3}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114297" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a3d00a01382246c96182b28c0570276bcacf1df888d27a5c8b5dc9411c899e97"} {"question" "q-114297" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114297" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)}{3}+C"] ["math" "3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)}{6}+C"] ["math" "\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)}{9}+C"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)-\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)}{3}+C"] ["math" "x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)}{3}+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114297" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)}{3}+C"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114314" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\int x{csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114314" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int x{csc}^{2}⁡x\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}={csc}^{2}⁡x\\, & ⟹\\,v=-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot {csc}^{2}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot (-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)-\\int (-\\operatorname{cot}⁡x)\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral using the substitution $u=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x,$ where $\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x{csc}^{2}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =-x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\int \\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|+C \\\\  & =-x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{sin}⁡x|+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114314" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a3d00a01382246c96182b28c0570276bcacf1df888d27a5c8b5dc9411c899e97"} {"question" "q-114314" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114314" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-2x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{sin}⁡x|+C"] ["math" "-x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{sin}⁡x|+C"] ["math" "-x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{cos}⁡x|+C"] ["math" "x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{sin}⁡x|+C"] ["math" "x\\operatorname{tan}⁡x-\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{cos}⁡x|+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114314" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-x\\operatorname{cot}⁡x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡|\\operatorname{sin}⁡x|+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114329" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{1/3}9x{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114329" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=9x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=9 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{-3x} & ⇒ & v=-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 9x\\cdot {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =9x\\cdot (-\\frac{{e}^{3x}}{3})-\\int (-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3})\\cdot 9\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-3x{e}^{-3x}+3\\int {e}^{-3x}\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/3}9x{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-3x{e}^{-3x}{|}_{0}^{1/3}+3{\\int }_{0}^{1/3}{e}^{-3x}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-3x{e}^{-3x}{|}_{0}^{1/3}-{e}^{-3x}{|}_{0}^{1/3} \\\\  & =-3[\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{-3(1/3)}-0\\cdot {e}^{-3\\cdot 0}]-[{e}^{-3(1/3)}-{e}^{-3\\cdot 0}] \\\\  & =-3[\\frac{{e}^{-1}}{3}-0]-[{e}^{-1}-1] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{e}-\\frac{1}{e}+1 \\\\  & =1-\\frac{2}{e} \\\\  & =\\frac{e-2}{e}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114329" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a3d00a01382246c96182b28c0570276bcacf1df888d27a5c8b5dc9411c899e97"} {"question" "q-114329" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114329" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{2e-3}{e}"] ["math" "\\frac{e+1}{e}"] ["math" "\\frac{e-2}{e+2}"] ["math" "\\frac{e-2}{e}"] ["math" "\\frac{e}{e+2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-114329" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{e-2}{e}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-349348" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{1}9x{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-349348" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=9x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=9 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{-3x} & ⇒ & v=-\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{-3x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 9x\\cdot {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =9x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{-3x})-\\int (-\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{-3x})\\cdot 9\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}9x{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-3x{e}^{-3x}\\,{|}_{0}^{1}-3{\\int }_{0}^{1}{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-3x{e}^{-3x}\\,{|}_{0}^{1}-{e}^{-3x}\\,{|}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =-3(1\\cdot {e}^{-3}-0\\cdot {e}^{0})-({e}^{-3}-{e}^{0}) \\\\  & =-3{e}^{-3}-({e}^{-3}-1) \\\\  & =1-4{e}^{-3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-349348" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a3d00a01382246c96182b28c0570276bcacf1df888d27a5c8b5dc9411c899e97"} {"question" "q-349348" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14063314/state.json" "file_sha256" "ab81f5d0db5ff13e6d370679bfae42d3078ab1190f8b2b5a8e76c8006f6a441b"} {"question" "q-349348" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1-4e^{-3}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/1406